{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Desert Angels is a third-person, story-driven exploration game set in a desert scrapyard. There's a generator buried in the scrapyard that can restore power to your village's water purification system, and save your people. Uncover the scrapyard's memories \u2014 or blast those memories to pieces \u2014 to find it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048770/extras/ExploreHeading.png?t=1744063270\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048770/extras/exploreLoopFade_v2.gif?t=1744063270\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through the striking landscape of the scrapyard at your own pace. There are no enemies or hazards, only layers upon layers of trash and the open sands. Discover the artifacts and relics scattered between the trash to compile your own understanding of the scrapyard's past.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048770/extras/DestroyHeading.png?t=1744063270\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once upon a time, the desert was ravaged by war, and to this day many of the weapons lying around the scrapyard are still operational.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048770/extras/shootLoop_v2.gif?t=1744063270\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find a variety of guns and explosives in the desert, and use them to blow up the trash standing in your way. Blast out new paths to discover shortcuts and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048770/extras/NarrativeHeading.png?t=1744063270\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the history and importance of the scrapyard bit by bit, as you explore the environment. Talk to the ghosts haunting the place \u2014 or ignore them. Investigate the trash and the stories that they tell \u2014 or destroy them.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What gets to be remembered, and what gets to be forgotten? The choices you make and the places you see will shape the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048770/extras/crashLanding.gif?t=1744063270\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3048770?t=1744063270","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3048770?t=1744063270","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048770/3d47fa506ff4784044ed672162abc7fb9f5d1a1d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744063270","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048770/3d47fa506ff4784044ed672162abc7fb9f5d1a1d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744063270","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3160970,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Desert Angels is a third-person, story-driven exploration game set in a desert scrapyard. There's a generator buried in the scrapyard that can restore power to your village's water purification system, and save your people. Uncover the scrapyard's memories \u2014 or blast those memories to pieces \u2014 to find it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048770/extras/ExploreHeading.png?t=1744063270\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048770/extras/exploreLoopFade_v2.gif?t=1744063270\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through the striking landscape of the scrapyard at your own pace. There are no enemies or hazards, only layers upon layers of trash and the open sands. Discover the artifacts and relics scattered between the trash to compile your own understanding of the scrapyard's past.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048770/extras/DestroyHeading.png?t=1744063270\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once upon a time, the desert was ravaged by war, and to this day many of the weapons lying around the scrapyard are still operational.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048770/extras/shootLoop_v2.gif?t=1744063270\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find a variety of guns and explosives in the desert, and use them to blow up the trash standing in your way. Blast out new paths to discover shortcuts and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048770/extras/NarrativeHeading.png?t=1744063270\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the history and importance of the scrapyard bit by bit, as you explore the environment. Talk to the ghosts haunting the place \u2014 or ignore them. Investigate the trash and the stories that they tell \u2014 or destroy them.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What gets to be remembered, and what gets to be forgotten? The choices you make and the places you see will shape the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048770/extras/crashLanding.gif?t=1744063270\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Folding Star"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048770/77de54a8ca7278c6abaf5784085d71edb5ce469c/header.jpg?t=1744063270","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 Big Sur<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal capable GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 13 Ventura<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal capable GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257123358,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123358/movie480.mp4?t=1744063269","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123358/movie_max.mp4?t=1744063269"},"name":"Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257123358/79c1c06087c66b91e57f0cacdb06da840f15763e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744063269","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123358/movie480_vp9.webm?t=